    futureDesc: 'Imodeli yokuqukethwe ye-DeHub ye-ERC-1155 emele ukuguquka kusuka ebuhlotsheni besikhashana bomsunguli-fan kuya ekubambisaneni kwezomnotho unomphela. Ngokuvumela abasunguli ukuthi benze noma yikuphi okufakiwe kube izingxenyana ezingu-1,000 zokuhweba, sisungula inkundla yokuqala lapho impumelelo yokusunguliwe izuzisa khona ngokuqondile nangomphelo wonke umuntu ohilelekile - abasunguli, abalandeli, nabatshalizimali - kuze kube phakade, ngaphandle kokudinga umzamo oqhubekayo noma ukuthembela enkundleni.',
    profileTitle: 'Yenza ngokwezifiso futhi ubuyekeze iphrofayili noma ishaneli yakho yomphakathi',
    profileDesc: 'Lawula lokho abasebenzisi abangakubona noma abangakwazi ukukubona ngenkathi bekwazi ukuthumela idatha yabalandeli bakho nganoma yisiphi isikhathi. Lokhu kukunika ubunikazi obugcwele besiteshi sakho futhi kukuvumela ukuthi uhambe nebhizinisi lakho nomaphi, kungakhathaliseki ukuthi kwenzekani.',
    topUpTitle: 'Phakamisa Amathokheni Ngokuchofoza Okungu-2',
    topUpShotAlt: 'Ukuthenga amathokheni e-DeHub ngokuqondile ngaphakathi kwe-app.',
    topUpDesc: 'Sinemali yethu ye-app, efana ne-Vbucks oyithola ngezinhlamvu zemali ze-Fortnite noma ze-TikTok, eyethu ibizwa ngokuthi amathokheni e-DeHub. Uzobona lezi njengezinhlamvu zemali zegolide kuyo yonke i-app. Zisetshenziselwa amasevisi e-premium njengamacebiso, okubhaliselwe nokunye. Ukubhrawuza kumahhala, futhi ngokufanayo nokuphosta ngaphakathi kwesibonelelo sansuku zonke esitholwa yi-akhawunti ngayinye — uma ubhalisa ngenhlalo, nge-imeyili noma nge-SMS, sixhasa zonke izindleko zegesi ngawe. Abasebenzisi be-Wallet bakhokha igesi ejwayelekile ye-ETH NOMA ye-BNB. Khuphula amathokheni ngokuchofoza okungu-2 ngezansi.',
