    instantPayments: 'Izinkokhelo Ezisheshayo',
    instantPaymentsDesc: 'Usebenzisa umucu, ungathenga amathokheni ngokushesha nangokulula kunoma iyiphi i-akhawunti ongene kuyo. I-DeHub yenza amathokheni abe lula nakubo bonke. Uma udinga usizo olwengeziwe, vele uvele engxoxweni yethu yomphakathi ebukhoma engu-24/7 bese ucela usizo lwabaqondisi.',
    secureGateway: 'Isango Elivikelekile',
    secureGatewayDesc: 'Yonke imininingwane yokukhokha ibethelwe futhi iphroseswe ngokuphephile yi-Stripe, asikwazi ukufinyelela noma ukugcina imininingwane yakho ebucayi noma imininingwane yekhadi ekunikeza ukuthula kwengqondo.',
    importantNotice: 'Isaziso Esibalulekile',
    tokenDisclaimer: 'Amathokheni e-DeHub asebenza njengamathokheni ezinto ezisetshenziswayo ohlelweni lwethu lwezinto eziphilayo, afana namakharensi angaphakathi komdlalo, futhi akuzona izimoto zokutshala imali. Nakuba ingqalasizinda yethu ye-blockchain ihlinzeka ngokusobala okungakaze kube khona ngaphambili kanye nedatha eqinisekisiwe ekhonjiwe ngezinjongo zemfundo, zonke izimakethe zinezingozi ezizalwa nazo. Ungalahlekelwa yiyo yonke imali oyitshalile ngenxa yokuguquguquka kwemakethe, izinkinga zobuchwepheshe, ukwephulwa kwezokuphepha, noma izimo ezingalindelekile. Bamba iqhaza kuphela ngezimali ongakwazi ukuzikhokhela ukuze ulahlekelwe ngokuphelele. I-DeHub namalungu ayo awabheki icala nganoma yikuphi ukulahlekelwa kwezezimali okwenzekile.',
    exploreTitle: 'Hlola i-App & Okungaphezulu',
    exploreDesc: 'Amabha okusesha ahlanganisa i-YouTube namanye ama-API amakhulu okusakaza ukuze ugcine ama-app amaningi, kuyilapho ikhasi lokuhlola liphinde lihlalise ingxoxo yethu yomphakathi ebukhoma namabhodi abaholi azinikele:',
    exploreFormula: 'Lokho ndawonye kuzonquma isabelo semali engenayo yesikhangiso (RS). I-algorithm eqondile yalokhu ingaphansi kwe-beta futhi ingashintsha kuye ngemali engenayo (RG)',
    exploreAlgorithm: 'Lena i-algorithm eyinhloko, futhi ukuhlolwa kwemivuzo kuzoqhubeka ngesisekelo sesivivinyo nephutha kuze kutholakale ukulingana okuphelele.',
    badgeTitle: 'Guqula Ibheji Lakho',
    badgeSubtitle: 'Ibheji Lemodeli Yokuhlonishwa',
    badgeDesc: 'Uma ubamba amathokheni amaningi e-DeHub, kulapho kunomvuzo ngokwengeziwe, kulula kanjalo. Lokhu kuhlanganisa kodwa akugcini nje ohlelweni lweBheji Lokuhlonishwa oluvula izimonyo ezithuthukisiwe kuphrofayili yakho yomphakathi kanye nezici ezithuthukisiwe, ze-premium.',
    badgePriceTitle: 'Isitebhisi sinenani lamadola',
    badgePriceDesc: 'Amabanga ayishumi nantathu, i-Crab ngokusebenzisa i-Megalodon, ngalinye libiza inani elinqunyiwe ngamadola kunenani elinqunyiwe lamathokheni. Inani lamathokheni e-DeHub ebanga elicelayo yilelo zindleko zedola ngenani elibukhoma, ngakho-ke ibheji lisho ukuzibophezela okufanayo noma yini eyenziwa imakethe. Izivikelo ezimbili zihambisana nayo: imfuneko ayikhuphuki ngaphezu kwezinombolo ezishicilelwe uma inani lehla, futhi uma usufinyelele ebangeni uyaligcina — ibheji olitholile likhiyiwe ngokuvumelana nemfuneko engabizi kakhulu eyake yatholwa kuyo, ngakho idiphu ayikwazi ukulisusa kuwe.',
    badgeUnlockTitle: 'Yeka ukuthi ibheji livula kanjani',
    badgeUnlock1: 'Inani eliphansi kumacebiso, ukubukwa kwenkokhelo ngayinye, okubhaliselwe nokunikezwayo, kwehla ngo-0.69% ebangeni.',
    badgeUnlock2: 'Isibonelelo esikhulu samahhala sokuphosta nsuku zonke, nesaphulelo kunoma yini edlulile.',
    badgeUnlock3: 'Isaphulelo esifanayo lapho uthenga amathokheni e-DeHub, kusuka ku-5% e-Crab kuya ku-30% e-Megalodon.',
    badgeUnlock5: 'Isisindo esengeziwe kulokho okwenzayo: ukubuka noma ukusabela okuvela kubheji kubalwa okwengeziwe, esitebhisini esifanayo nokuvota kokubusa — esinye singenalo ibheji, ezimbili e-Crab, kanye nesilinganiso esengeziwe ebangeni ngalinye elingaphezulu kwalo kuze kube yishumi nane e-Megalodon. Kuyinto ephindaphindiwe ekusabeleni kwakho okukodwa, hhayi okwesibili.',
    badgeDelegationTitle: 'Nikeza ibheji lakho',
    badgeDelegationDesc: 'Ibheji lingaboleka. Yonke i-rung oyikhuphukile ikunika isikhala esisodwa sezihambeli — esisodwa e-Crab, eseshumi nantathu e-Megalodon — futhi isikhala ngasinye sinikeza enye i-akhawunti ebangeni lakho uma nje usishiya lapho. Likhona ngoba ithonya ku-DeHub lihloselwe ukuhamba neqembu kunokuba lihlale esikhwameni esisodwa: izisebenzi, amaqembu nama-akhawunti wesibili athola ibanga umsekeli wawo alibambile, kungekho muntu ohambisa amathokheni noma odlulisela okhiye.',
    badgeDelegationB1: 'Ibanga elifanayo, hhayi elilodwa ngezansi:',
    badgeDelegationB1Desc: 'I-Megalodon iboleka i-Megalodon. Ibheji lifuna ithonya oliyalayo, ngakho abantu obabuyayo baphatha lokho okuphethe.',
    badgeDelegationB2: 'Izikhala zivela esigxotsheni sakho:',
    badgeDelegationB2Desc: 'Ibheji ebolekiwe ayinazo izikhala zayo, ngakho ibanga lokuboleka alisoze labolekwe.',
    badgeDelegationB3: 'Ilungu lisesidlangalaleni:',
    badgeDelegationB3Desc: 'Hambisa ibheji elinikeziwe noma kuphi ku-app futhi ibala ukuthi ubani olisekelayo. Akukho lutho olufihliwe mayelana nokuthi ibanga livelaphi.',
    badgeDelegationB4: 'Kungashintshwa nganoma yisiphi isikhathi:',
    badgeDelegationB4Desc: 'Buyisela isikhala emuva bese ibanga libuyela kuwe. Ibanga lakho lokuthengisa, lemali kanye nebheji elikhiyiwe akuthintwa yinoma yini oyibolekisayo.',
    badgeDelegationB5: 'Isimo, hhayi amalungelo:',
    badgeDelegationB5Desc: 'Ibheji lemali ebolekiwe yilokho okuboniswa yipulatifomu, futhi ithwala isisindo esihambisana nebanga — umbono noma ukusabela okuvela kulo kubalwa ebangeni ebolekiwe ngalo. Lokho engakuthwali yilutho olubizayo ngemali: ibanga lakho lemali, isaphulelo sakho sokuthenga amathokheni, imali yakho yokuphosta yansuku zonke nezikhala zezithunywa zakho zonke zisafundwa esigxotsheni ozibambile.',
    badgeDelegationB6: 'Nikeza noma iyiphi i-rung oyikhuphulile:',
    badgeDelegationB6Desc: 'Isikhala akudingeki sidlulisele isigaba sakho esiphezulu. Khetha umngcelele ongavaliwe obolekisayo, bese ubuyisela othile e-King Cobra ngaphandle kokumenza abe yi-Megalodon.',
    badgeDelegationB7: 'Olunye uhlangothi lunezwi:',
    badgeDelegationB7Desc: 'Ibheji elinikezwe i-akhawunti liyavela kwinsimbi yabo yesaziso, futhi bangayenqaba. Noma ubani kini angaqeda izithunywa kamuva.',
    tipTitle: 'Icebiso Ngezintandokazi Zakho',
    tipDesc1: 'Amasevisi ethu amacebiso ahlanganisiwe kukho konke ukufakwa nokusakazwa bukhoma afika nezindleko ezingu-10% kuphela, uma kuqhathaniswa no-60% ovamile okhokhiswa abanjengo-TikTok nabanye abaholi bemboni kuyilapho bekwazi nokuvota ekukhanseleni kwevidiyo okubuyisela amandla ezandleni zombukeli.',
    tipDesc2: 'Amacebiso atholakele abasunguli namacebiso anikezwe ababukeli angene ngemvume emabhodini abaholi ahlukene kanye nezibalo zababukeli nababhalisile abanquma amasheya emalini engenayo yezikhangiso. Ababambiqhaza bamathokheni e-DeHub bathola amasheya abo alinganiselwe enzuzo ephelele yephrothokholi.',
