    mineDesc1: 'Ama-wallet ambalwa kuphela abamba amathokheni angaphezu kuka-50m we-DeHub, amaningi awo angama-wallet asebenzayo, namalungu omphakathi asele ayaziwa.',
    mineDesc2: 'Iqembu eliyinhloko noma abanikazi bamabheji ebanga eliphakeme kuphela abazoba namandla okususa ividiyo ngokushesha ngokushisa i-NFT ehlobene nayo. Kamuva, yonke imali engenayo yezikhangiso eyenziwe nanoma yimuphi umdlalo wokuthola imali eboshelwe kuvidiyo izokwabelwana ngayo nazo zonke izikhwama zokuvota ukuze kuvinjelwe abadlali ababi ngokwengeziwe futhi kugqugquzelwe umphakathi ohilelekile.',
    mineDynamic: 'Inani lamathokheni e-DeHub adingekayo kuwo wonke amasevisi liyashintshashintsha, ngakho kumelwe lishintshwe nganoma yisiphi isikhathi maqondana nenani. Noma yiluphi ushintsho luzomenyezelwa emphakathini kuzo zonke iziteshi ezisemthethweni.',
