    superPowersTitle: 'Ngqongqo eNhlangano',
    superPowersDesc: 'Ama-SuperPower aguqula ibheji lokukhangisa libe ukufinyelela ongakusebenzisa. Njalo ngemva kwamasonto amabili ibheji lakho liyakhuphuka, futhi ukuchitha elilodwa kubeka iphosti esikhaleni phezulu ku-feed yasekhaya. Ithimba livulekele wonke umuntu futhi lihlanganisa amandla e-wallet afinyelela kuma-akhawunti ayisishiyagalombili, okunikeza wonke amalungu ibheji ingqikithi yokuvula kwawo. Isikhala siyajikeleza: lapho ukukhuphula okuningana kusebenza, ababukeli baphathwa ngesisindo esisodwa ngebanga lebheji, ngakho ibanga eliphakeme liboniswa kaningi futhi wonke umuntu usathola iwindi alinikeziwe.',
    superPowersDescV2: 'Ama-SuperPower aguqula ibheji lokukhangisa libe ukufinyelela ongakusebenzisa. Njalo ngemva kwamasonto amabili ibheji lakho liyakhuphuka, futhi ukuchitha elilodwa kubeka iphosti esikhaleni phezulu ku-feed yasekhaya. Ithimba livulekele wonke umuntu futhi lihlanganisa amandla e-wallet afinyelela kuma-akhawunti ayisishiyagalombili, okunikeza wonke amalungu ibheji ingqikithi yokuvula kwawo. Isikhala siyajikeleza: lapho ukukhuphula okuningana kusebenza, ababukeli baphathwa ngesisindo esisodwa ngebanga lebheji, ngakho ibanga eliphakeme liboniswa kaningi futhi wonke umuntu usathola iwindi alinikeziwe.',
    boostPower: '1) Thuthukisa',
