    trendJacker: '4) I-Trend Jacker',
    trendJackerDesc2: 'Beka esinye sezigaba zakho phezulu ohlwini oluthrendayo. Vula e-Giant Tortoise. Phila manje.',
    timelineBomber: '5) I-Timeline Bomber',
    timelineBomberDesc2: 'Abalandeli bakho babona iphosti yakho ngaphambi kokuthuthukiswa yinoma ubani omunye — i-King Cobra ishaya i-Megalodon kubantu abakhethe ukuzwa kuwe. Uvula e-King Cobra. Phila manje.',
    precisionStrike: '8) Isiteleka Sokunemba',
    precisionStrikeDesc: 'Finyelela abantu abalandela i-akhawunti obabiza ngayo. Ivula e-Dolphin. Phila manje.',
    harpoon: '9) I-Harpoon',
    harpoonDesc: 'Yazisa wonke umnikazi ebangeni lebheji olikhethayo mayelana nephosti eyodwa. Kuvuleka e-Tiger Shark. Phila manje.',
    superPowersMore2: 'Wonke amandla ayishumi nambili abukhoma futhi afakwe ku-app. I-Anchor yokuphawula igcina ukuphawula kwakho phezulu emiyalezweni yomunye umuntu. I-Signal Flare ithumela isaziso esisodwa kuyo yonke i-akhawunti elandelayo. I-Flak Jacket yenza iphosti ingavikelekile ekungcwabeni phansi ngenkathi isebenza. Ithimba livumela ama-akhawunti amaningi afinyelela kwayisishiyagalombili ahlanganise amandla esikhwama sawo semali, ukuze wonke amalungu agqoke ibheji lokuvula ibhalansi yawo. I-Front Row ibeka Isiteji osibungazayo phezulu kojantshi wezigaba. I-Deep Current inikeza okunye kokuthunyelwe kwakho kuphosti yomunye umuntu.',
    superPowersMoreV2: 'Wonke amandla ayishumi nambili abukhoma futhi afakwe ku-app. I-Anchor yokuphawula igcina ukuphawula kwakho phezulu emiyalezweni yomunye umuntu. I-Signal Flare ithumela isaziso esisodwa kuyo yonke i-akhawunti elandelayo. I-Flak Jacket yenza iphosti ingavikelekile ekungcwabeni phansi ngenkathi isebenza. Ithimba livumela ama-akhawunti amaningi afinyelela kwayisishiyagalombili ahlanganise amandla esikhwama sawo semali, ukuze wonke amalungu agqoke ibheji lokuvula ibhalansi yawo. I-Front Row ibeka Isiteji osibungazayo phezulu kojantshi wezigaba. I-Deep Current inikeza okunye kokuthunyelwe kwakho kuphosti yomunye umuntu.',
