    spLadderDesc: 'Kukhuphuka ubusuku obubodwa, nokuthi ngayinye ihamba isikhathi esingakanani. Ayikho ikholomu eyehla njengoba ukhuphuka, futhi ingqikithi ikhuphuka njalo.',
