    spRotationDesc: 'Isikhala siyajikeleza kunamaphini. Lapho ukukhuphula okuningana kusebenza ngasikhathi sinye, isibukeli ngasinye sisingathwa esisodwa, sinesisindo sebanga lebheji le-booster — ibanga eliphakeme liboniswa kaningi, futhi wonke umuntu usathola iwindi alikhokhele. Lokho okuthengwa yikhuthazo yisabelo sezwi semizuzu ethile, hhayi kuphela ukuba nendawo ephezulu ye-feed.',
    spCycleTitle: 'Iwashi elilodwa lawo wonke umuntu',
