    feedsReactionsDesc: 'Ukusabela okuyishumi kuhlala ngemuva kwenkinobho efana nayo: njengokuthi, uthando, inhlonipho, kushisa, 100, lol, ukudabuka, ukukhala, i-poo nokungathandi. Yonke ngaphandle kokungathandi ibalwa engqikithini efana nengqikithi yephosti. Thepha kabili iphosti ukuze uyithande, thepha kathathu ukuze uyithande, bese ubamba inkinobho ukuze uvule itreyi, ebonisa ukuthi ubani osabele nokuthi yini. I-ayikhoni ehamba phambili ekhadini yinoma yikuphi ukusabela okudwetshwe yiphosti kakhulu. Ukusabela kucatshangelwa yibheji le-reactor, ngakho ubani osabele ngezinto kanye nokuthi bangaki abakwenzile. Imodi engakwesobunxele kokuthi Amasethingi ihambisa inkinobho efana nayo ngakwesobunxele sebha.',
