    ourServiceText2: 'I-DeHub isebenza njengephrothokholi ehlukanisiwe lapho ukulinganisela okusunguliwe kusingathwa ukuphathwa komphakathi, ukuqinisekisa ukuthi okusunguliwe okungekho emthethweni kuphela noma okusunguliwe okwephula iziqondiso ezigunyazwe umphakathi kungavinjelwa.',
